OL,3,GNEWSAAI is taking my work, claims
OL,4,Agraphic designer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA graphic designer has said he is
OL,7,Flosing business due to smaller firms
OL,8,Fchoosing to generate their own content
OL,9,Fusing artificial intelligence (AI).
OL,11,FDanny Williams, from East Yorkshire,
OL,12,Fsaid he understood why companies, in
OL,13,Ftough economic times, would choose to
OL,14,Fgo down the AI path.
OL,16,FHe added: "With smaller businesses, the
OL,17,Ffunding isn't there for graphic design
OL,18,For big media packs."
