OL,5,
OL,6,FStephen Woodford, CEO of the
OL,7,FAdvertising Association, said the
OL,8,Findustry was seeing "rapid change"
OL,9,Fthrough the adoption of AI, but said
OL,10,Fstrict rules need to be adhered to.
